  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut the sweet potato and carrot into small chunks.\n• Place the sweet potato and carrot on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat, then bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60d04088d79723697473b5fc/step-55d39e5e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the veggies are roasting, thinly slice the brown onion. Finely chop the garlic. Drain and rinse the black beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60d04088d79723697473b5fc/step-f47253ea.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat. Cook the onion until softened, 4-5 minutes. Add the black beans, garlic and All-American spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Add 1/2 the enchilada sauce to the frying pan. Add a splash of water if the filling looks dry. Stir to combine and season to taste. Remove from the heat and stir through the roasted veggies.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60d04088d79723697473b5fc/step-a5bda842.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce the oven temperature to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Drizzle a baking dish with olive oil.\n• Lay the mini flour tortillas (see ingredients) on a chopping board. Spoon the enchilada filling down the centre of each tortilla. Roll tightly and place, seam-side down, in the baking dish. Pour over the remaining enchilada sauce and sprinkle with the shredded Cheddar cheese. Bake until golden, 10-12 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60d04088d79723697473b5fc/step-9a5be172.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the enchiladas are baking, finely chop the cucumber and tomato. In a medium bowl, combine the cucumber, tomato, white wine vinegar and a drizzle of olive oil. Season and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60d04088d79723697473b5fc/step-996eb682.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "TIP: This is a mild sauce, but use less if you're sensitive to heat! Divide the American sweet potato and black bean enchiladas between plates and top with Greek-style yoghurt and the salsa. Drizzle over the mild chipotle sauce to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60d04088d79723697473b5fc/step-61855946.jpg"
    }
  ]
